    "title": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> `local_astro.exists()` returns `True` for dir",
    "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> `local_astro.exists()` returns `True` for directories and symlinks in addition to regular files. A directory named `astro` coincidentally placed at `node_modules/.bin/astro` would be selected as the binary and then fail at subprocess execution with a confusing `IsADirectoryError`. Using `is_file()` makes the intent unambiguous and avoids that edge case.\n\n```suggestion\n        if cwd is not None:\n            local_astro = cwd / \"node_modules\" / \".bin\" / \"astro\"\n            if local_astro.is_file():\n                return [str(local_astro), \"check\"]\n```\n\n<a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/ide/cursor?prompt=This%20is%20a%20comment%20left%20during%20a%20code%20review.%0APath%3A%20lintro%2Ftools%2Fdefinitions%2Fastro_check.py%0ALine%3A%20120-123%0A%0AComment%3A%0A%60local_astro.exists%28%29%60%20returns%20%60True%60%20for%20directories%20and%20symlinks%20in%20addition%20to%20regular%20files.%20A%20directory%20named%20%60astro%60%20coincidentally%20placed%20at%20%60node_modules%2F.bin%2Fastro%60%20would%20be%20selected%20as%20the%20binary%20and%20then%20fail%20at%20subprocess%20execution%20with%20a%20confusing%20%60IsADirectoryError%60.%20Using%20%60is_file%28%29%60%20makes%20the%20intent%20unambiguous%20and%20avoids%20that%20edge%20case.%0A%0A%60%60%60suggestion%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20cwd%20is%20not%20None%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20local_astro%20%3D%20cwd%20%2F%20%22node_modules%22%20%2F%20%22.bin%22%20%2F%20%22astro%22%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20local_astro.is_file%28%29%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%5Bstr%28local_astro%29%2C%20%22check%22%5D%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AHow%20can%20I%20resolve%20this%3F%20If%20you%20propose%20a%20fix%2C%20please%20make%20it%20concise.&pr=958&platform=github\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\