    "title": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> The `get_subprocess_env` import is placed in ",
    "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> The `get_subprocess_env` import is placed in the middle of the `check` method alongside an unrelated import (`install_node_deps`). Moving it to the module-level imports makes the dependency immediately visible and avoids repeated import lookups on every `check` call.\n\n```suggestion\n        run_env = get_subprocess_env()\n```\n\nNote: If this suggestion doesn't match your team's coding style, reply to this and let me know. I'll remember it for next time!\n\n<a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/ide/cursor?prompt=This%20is%20a%20comment%20left%20during%20a%20code%20review.%0APath%3A%20lintro%2Ftools%2Fdefinitions%2Fastro_check.py%0ALine%3A%20345-347%0A%0AComment%3A%0AThe%20%60get_subprocess_env%60%20import%20is%20placed%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20the%20%60check%60%20method%20alongside%20an%20unrelated%20import%20%28%60install_node_deps%60%29.%20Moving%20it%20to%20the%20module-level%20imports%20makes%20the%20dependency%20immediately%20visible%20and%20avoids%20repeated%20import%20lookups%20on%20every%20%60check%60%20call.%0A%0A%60%60%60suggestion%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20run_env%20%3D%20get_subprocess_env%28%29%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AHow%20can%20I%20resolve%20this%3F%20If%20you%20propose%20a%20fix%2C%20please%20make%20it%20concise.&pr=958&platform=github\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCursorDark.svg?v=3\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCursor.svg?v=3\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCursor.svg?v=3\" height=\"20\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/ide/claude-code?prompt=This%20is%20a%20comment%20left%20during%20a%20code%20review.%0APath%3A%20lintro%2Ftools%2Fdefinitions%2Fastro_check